Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:09.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,P Q C Vault Bench is a zero dependency workbench for post quantum cryptography, U T X O quantum migration and the Q Day Aevum testnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:17.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Everything runs in the page with plain JavaScript: no build step, no packages, and no background network calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:24.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,The hero runs one click defend, attack and replay demos computed from the real engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:28.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every figure on screen is a live computation, not a mock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:41.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,The number theoretic transform multiplies polynomials in the Kyber ring through seven Cooley Tukey stages, and its zeta table matches the FIPS 203 Montgomery roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:55.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,M L K E M key encapsulation runs educational parameter sets carrying the real FIPS 203 names, with centered binomial sampling, compression and Fujisaki Okamoto implicit rejection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:01:04.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,Correctness sweeps report the exact decryption failure, tamper rejection and wrong key counts for every parameter set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:11.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,W O T S plus signs a message over sixty seven hash chains, and its checksum blocks forgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:19.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,X M S S stacks those one time keys into a Merkle tree with authentication paths, leaf exhaustion and verification.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.15,0:01:32.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,A Shor and Grover analyzer scores the quantum exposure of secp256k1, R S A 2048 and the NIST schemes, while a U T X O meter prices harvest now decrypt later risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:44.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,The FIPS matrix lays all eighteen approved parameter sets side by side with recomputed byte sizes, security categories and a closed form operation cost model.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.07,0:01:54.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Q Day Aevum panel binds risk attestations and X M S S signatures to t U S D 8 settlement calldata on chain 44005.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:02:04.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,A seventeen check verifier proves every binding: wrong chains, expired deadlines, replayed nonces and foreign tree signatures all fail closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.94,0:02:14.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,The migration workbench compares five regimes across four treasury profiles on a Pareto frontier with all eighteen parameter sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.04,0:02:24.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,The audited brief stamps one S H A 256 digest across the page, J S O N, C S V and Markdown, checked by fifteen in page self tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:31.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,Four hundred fifty seven Node tests pass with zero failures, re verified inside this recording run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.83,0:02:38.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,P Q C Vault Bench. Educational primitives, honest estimates, and no custody of real funds.
